## Two feeds (mental model)

| Audience | Feed URL | How installers appear |
|----------|----------|------------------------|
| **Team / internal testing** | `https://releases.okvevo.com/okvevo/staging` | Auto after merge to `staging` (**Desktop staging**) |
| **Customers / real users** | `https://releases.okvevo.com/okvevo/stable` (app); root stable names + root `latest*.yml` also written by Publish | Tag pack archives versioned objects → Karan runs **Publish release** |

Stable public download names:

- Staging: `https://releases.okvevo.com/okvevo/staging/OkVevo-mac-arm64.dmg` and `…/OkVevo-win-x64.exe`
- Production (after Publish): `https://releases.okvevo.com/OkVevo-mac-arm64.dmg` and `…/OkVevo-win-x64.exe`

Versioned objects: `OkVevo-{ver}-mac-arm64.dmg`, `OkVevo-{ver}-win-x64.exe`, plus Mac zip (blockmaps on production); archived yml under `versions/{ver}/`.

